* Reveal the legacy login form
For the legacy application that uses `form#frm-loginForm`, reveal the form in the browser console:
@code javascript
$('form#frm-loginForm').css('display', 'block');
@end
Enter the account email and password manually in the form. This depends on the old DOM structure and jQuery being present.
Credentials belong in the password manager, not in this page or a saved console command.
